
%9Syntax:%9

@SYNTAX:unkeepnick@

%9Parameters:%9

    The network (chatnet); defaults to the network of the active window's
    server.

%9Description:%9

    Stops keeping the nick on the given network and removes the network's
    keepnick option (the configuration is saved at once with
    keepnick_autosave ON). On a connection that keeps its nick through
    keepnick_auto, stops that too.

    When nothing is kept on that network, erssi says so. In a window
    without a network (e.g. Notices) give the network name.

%9Examples:%9

    /UNKEEPNICK
    /UNKEEPNICK IRCnet

%9See also:%9 KEEPNICK, LISTNICK

